    "updated_at": "2016-10-06T10:44:09Z",
    "body": "Hrm. They're script-closable because they're \"a top-level browsing context whose session history contains only one Document.\" I guess I wouldn't be terribly sad if they were no longer script-closable, but it doesn't seem obviously wrong that they are.\n\nDo you think we need to address that in this patch?\n",
